  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 401.01 Applicability. The rules in this chapter shall apply to collection, storage, and transfer (C/S/T) facilities, including transfer stations and recycling facilities.\n\nSource. #5172, eff 7-1-91; ss by #6535, INTERIM, eff 7-1-97, EXPIRES: 10-29-97; ss by #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 400); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2101.01); ss by #10596, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14093, eff 10-4-24",
